{"id":"u-2394ae56-47a0-4b45-b338-b0a861167217","src":"community","title":"Becoming Jael","author":"Maeg Grace","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/xeXNBW-becoming-jael","desc":"Becoming Jael is 6 weeks of Strength, Perseverance & Faith.\n  \"Most blessed of women be Jael...\"- Judges 5:24\n   Jael's story is one of courage, perseverance, and strength in an unexpected moment. Becoming Jael is my 6 week journey to build those qualities in myself- no only physically, but mentally and spiritually.\n   3 full-body workouts each week will help in becoming stronger, more capable, and more disciplined. This is NOT about perfection either. Miss a workout? Keep going. Don't start over, stop, or think you failed. \n   Every rep is a reminder:\n-We can do hard things.\n-Progress takes patience.\n-Setbacks DO NOT erase progress.\n-Strength is built one day at a time.\n-God is with us through the process.\n   Over these 6 weeks, we are not just changing our bodies. We are becoming Stronger, Braver, more Disciplined, and more willing to Persevere. We are Becoming Jael!","level":["Intermediate","Novice"],"goals":["Women's","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-20T23:25:10.587Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":300}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hip Abductor (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dead Bug","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":720}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":600}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat 